 available&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div> And that's not all! </div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><h2 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"UpdateHeading ng-star-inserted\">Use \"Cash + Miles\" to pay for extra services:</h2><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n<div>\n<section class=\"custom-content__section section-sub\">\n<ol class=\"ol-items\">\n\n    <div class=\"ol-list-wrapper\">\n\n    <div class=\"ol-look\">\n        \n    <li class=\"ng-star-inserted li-items \">\n    <span class=\"icon-section\">\n        <span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon\"> \n            done \n        </span>\n    </span></li>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ol-list-contents ol-contents-heading\">\n    Seat selection \n    </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ol-list-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"ol-look\">\n    <li class=\"li-items\"><span class=\"icon-section\">\n        <span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon\"> \n            done \n        </span></span></li>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ol-list-contents ol-contents-heading\">\n    Extra baggage\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ol-list-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"ol-look\">\n    <li class=\"li-items\"><span class=\"icon-section\">\n        <span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon\"> \n            done \n        </span></span></li>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"ol-list-contents ol-contents-heading\">\n    Extended baggage weight\n    </div>\n\n    </div>\n \n<!----\n    <div class=\"ol-contents-heading\">\n    Enjoy it all through flexible choices, simple steps, and a single tap on the Saudia app or website. \n    </div>\n--->\n\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n\n\n</ol>\n</section></div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">Frequently asked questions</h2><!----><div class=\"all-faqs ng-star-inserted\"><a id=\"viewAllFaq\" class=\"faq_link_button ng-star-inserted\" target=\"_self\" href=\"/en-SA/Support/HelpAndSupport/FAQs\n                  \" aria-label=\"Click here for frequently asked questions \"><span> View all FAQs </span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined faq_icon icon-Link_chevron\"> chevron_right </span></a><!----></div><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-0 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserte