rigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-2\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">You can use Cash + Miles:<br>\n<br>\n- when booking flights on the Saudia website or mobile app<br>\n<br>\n<!-----\n- or via the Manage <strong>My Bookings</strong> section for ancillary extra only Example:<br />\n<br />\n&bull; Seat selection<br />\n<br />\n&bull; Extra baggage<br />\n<br />\n&bull; Extended baggage weight beyond 23KG.\n----></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Is there a minimum number of Miles required to use the service? \" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"> Is there a minimum number of Miles required to use the service?  </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-4\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ol>A minimum of:&nbsp;<br>\n    <br>\n    - 2,000 Reward Miles to purchase a flight tickets<br>\n    <br>\n    - 500 Reward Miles to purchase an ancillary service</ol></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I use Cash + Miles for partner airline flights? \" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> Can I use Cash + Miles for partner airline flights?  </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ol>No, this option is only available for flights operated by Saudia.</ol></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"What’s the difference between Cash + Miles and a reward Ticket? \" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"> What’s the difference between Cash + Miles and a reward Ticket?  </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-8\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">- <strong>Redemption Ticket:</strong> Paid entirely with Reward Miles.<br>\n<br>\n- <strong>Cash + Miles:</strong> Combines Miles and cash to pay for tickets or services.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-space class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-spacer-component\"></div></app-jss-space><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text-button class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-title-text-button-container ng-star-inserted\"><h2 appaddtextlimit=\"\" class=\"title ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Terms and Conditions</span><!----></h2><!----><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"cms-list-component\"><ul class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Cash + Miles</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p>This implementation is designed to support a substantial demand to expand Saudia’s payment options by providing AlFursan members with a more instant and flexible method of utilizing their earned &amp; accumulated reward Miles in the membership. </p></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>The service is considered as a new form of payment on SV flights to be used only on any 1st issuance of any tickets and/or some selected ancillaries by combining a minimum balance of Miles with other forms of payment such as cash or acceptable credit cards</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p>◦ The Miles can be exchanged against the fares not including taxes and fees. <br>\n\n◦ The minimum Miles required are 2000 Miles for tickets; and 500 Miles for ancillary. </p></span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>Individual members can take advantage of the Branded Fares process to purchase tickets and services, which include the same benefits and some restrictions, such as accumulating Miles, upgrading eligibility, changes, and cancellations</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p>◦ Upon any changes (through digital channels, the difference will be collected using credit cards if the change is to a higher fare, while changes to a lower fare will automatically be refunded the remaining Miles after deducting any fees.  <br>\n\n◦ Prior to processing the request at Saudia's Call Centres and Sales Offices, fees may be collected separately.  </p>\n\n</span><!----></div></li><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"icon-section\"><span class=\"material-icons-outlined done-icon ng-star-inserted\"> done </span><!----><!----><!----></span><div class=\"list-content\"><h3>In case of circumstances beyond SAUDIA's control or any unforeseen flight disruptions, \"SAUDIA\" will take all necessary measures to accommodate all guest requests. Nevertheless, requests for involuntary changes or refunds will be allowed in case of flight delays or cancellations according to \"SAUDIA\" policies. \n</h3><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p>◦ Involuntary refunds will be made in the same currency and payment method as at purchase\n\n</p></span><!----></div></li><!----></ul><!----><!----></div></app-jss-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}